[
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.919",
    "end": "00:00:09.798",
    "start_seconds": 5.919,
    "end_seconds": 9.798,
    "text": "So when people find out that I study antidepressants,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.839",
    "end": "00:00:11.007",
    "start_seconds": 9.839,
    "end_seconds": 11.007,
    "text": "they often ask,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.049",
    "end": "00:00:12.342",
    "start_seconds": 11.049,
    "end_seconds": 12.342,
    "text": "how do they work?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.884",
    "end": "00:00:15.971",
    "start_seconds": 12.884,
    "end_seconds": 15.971,
    "text": "And people are surprised to learn, we don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.014",
    "end": "00:00:21.309",
    "start_seconds": 18.014,
    "end_seconds": 21.309,
    "text": "And part of that surprise comes from the fact that we've been told"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.309",
    "end": "00:00:23.603",
    "start_seconds": 21.309,
    "end_seconds": 23.603,
    "text": "that depression is a chemical imbalance,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.603",
    "end": "00:00:25.772",
    "start_seconds": 23.603,
    "end_seconds": 25.772,
    "text": "that you don't make enough serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.064",
    "end": "00:00:28.316",
    "start_seconds": 26.064,
    "end_seconds": 28.316,
    "text": "And we know that antidepressants,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.358",
    "end": "00:00:31.945",
    "start_seconds": 28.358,
    "end_seconds": 31.945,
    "text": "SSRIs are the most common antidepressant prescribed,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.987",
    "end": "00:00:33.488",
    "start_seconds": 31.987,
    "end_seconds": 33.488,
    "text": "increase serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.863",
    "end": "00:00:35.740",
    "start_seconds": 33.863,
    "end_seconds": 35.74,
    "text": "And so they think that what we're doing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.740",
    "end": "00:00:38.451",
    "start_seconds": 35.74,
    "end_seconds": 38.451,
    "text": "is we're fixing depression by increasing serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.411",
    "end": "00:00:41.454",
    "start_seconds": 39.411,
    "end_seconds": 41.454,
    "text": "But that's not the whole story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.496",
    "end": "00:00:43.790",
    "start_seconds": 41.496,
    "end_seconds": 43.79,
    "text": "In fact, that may not even be the story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.165",
    "end": "00:00:46.126",
    "start_seconds": 44.165,
    "end_seconds": 46.126,
    "text": "What I'm going to talk to you today about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.126",
    "end": "00:00:47.752",
    "start_seconds": 46.126,
    "end_seconds": 47.752,
    "text": "is some of our work with ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.794",
    "end": "00:00:51.673",
    "start_seconds": 47.794,
    "end_seconds": 51.673,
    "text": "a really remarkable drug that has rapid antidepressant effects."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.673",
    "end": "00:00:54.217",
    "start_seconds": 51.673,
    "end_seconds": 54.217,
    "text": "And it doesn't correct a chemical imbalance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.259",
    "end": "00:00:57.262",
    "start_seconds": 54.259,
    "end_seconds": 57.262,
    "text": "It actually causes the brain to change, to adapt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.888",
    "end": "00:01:03.143",
    "start_seconds": 58.888,
    "end_seconds": 63.143,
    "text": "So when we talk about antidepressants, we first have to start with depression."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.143",
    "end": "00:01:04.936",
    "start_seconds": 63.143,
    "end_seconds": 64.936,
    "text": "And everyone uses the term depressed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.978",
    "end": "00:01:06.146",
    "start_seconds": 64.978,
    "end_seconds": 66.146,
    "text": "We hear it all the time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.146",
    "end": "00:01:09.649",
    "start_seconds": 66.146,
    "end_seconds": 69.649,
    "text": "\"I feel depressed, I feel sad, I have melancholy.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.650",
    "end": "00:01:14.738",
    "start_seconds": 70.65,
    "end_seconds": 74.738,
    "text": "Creative expression of depression is very common."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.779",
    "end": "00:01:18.366",
    "start_seconds": 74.779,
    "end_seconds": 78.366,
    "text": "For centuries, people have tried to express the feeling of depressed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.366",
    "end": "00:01:19.576",
    "start_seconds": 78.366,
    "end_seconds": 79.576,
    "text": "or melancholy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.618",
    "end": "00:01:24.164",
    "start_seconds": 79.618,
    "end_seconds": 84.164,
    "text": "For example, Picasso, as illustrated in these paintings,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.164",
    "end": "00:01:27.917",
    "start_seconds": 84.164,
    "end_seconds": 87.917,
    "text": "went through his blue period and his painting style changed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.501",
    "end": "00:01:32.172",
    "start_seconds": 88.501,
    "end_seconds": 92.172,
    "text": "It really portrayed a sense of sadness, of gloom."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.256",
    "end": "00:01:34.966",
    "start_seconds": 93.256,
    "end_seconds": 94.96600000000001,
    "text": "We know that writers do this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.008",
    "end": "00:01:36.843",
    "start_seconds": 95.00800000000001,
    "end_seconds": 96.843,
    "text": "Poets, I mean, you can read a poem"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.885",
    "end": "00:01:39.220",
    "start_seconds": 96.88499999999999,
    "end_seconds": 99.22,
    "text": "and literally be moved to tears by the words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.763",
    "end": "00:01:41.139",
    "start_seconds": 99.763,
    "end_seconds": 101.13900000000001,
    "text": "Musicians."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.181",
    "end": "00:01:43.224",
    "start_seconds": 101.181,
    "end_seconds": 103.22399999999999,
    "text": "How many sad songs do we hear?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.767",
    "end": "00:01:47.687",
    "start_seconds": 103.767,
    "end_seconds": 107.687,
    "text": "Eric Clapton's \"Tears in Heaven\", about the loss of his son,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.729",
    "end": "00:01:49.064",
    "start_seconds": 107.729,
    "end_seconds": 109.064,
    "text": "is heartbreaking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.523",
    "end": "00:01:53.652",
    "start_seconds": 110.523,
    "end_seconds": 113.652,
    "text": "But major depression is more than just sadness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.652",
    "end": "00:01:56.780",
    "start_seconds": 113.652,
    "end_seconds": 116.78,
    "text": "It's a serious medical condition,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.780",
    "end": "00:01:58.281",
    "start_seconds": 116.78,
    "end_seconds": 118.281,
    "text": "especially left untreated."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.240",
    "end": "00:02:04.454",
    "start_seconds": 119.24000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 124.454,
    "text": "Depression is really the dulling of emotion,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.496",
    "end": "00:02:06.456",
    "start_seconds": 124.496,
    "end_seconds": 126.456,
    "text": "really losing interest"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.498",
    "end": "00:02:08.833",
    "start_seconds": 126.498,
    "end_seconds": 128.833,
    "text": "and sometimes completely withdrawing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.542",
    "end": "00:02:11.586",
    "start_seconds": 129.542,
    "end_seconds": 131.586,
    "text": "The symptoms of depression can vary."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.420",
    "end": "00:02:15.715",
    "start_seconds": 132.42,
    "end_seconds": 135.715,
    "text": "Some people, it may impact more appetite,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.757",
    "end": "00:02:16.883",
    "start_seconds": 135.757,
    "end_seconds": 136.883,
    "text": "others sleep."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.342",
    "end": "00:02:21.096",
    "start_seconds": 137.34199999999998,
    "end_seconds": 141.096,
    "text": "It may have effects on concentration, memory."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.137",
    "end": "00:02:22.305",
    "start_seconds": 141.137,
    "end_seconds": 142.305,
    "text": "A range of things."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.347",
    "end": "00:02:24.641",
    "start_seconds": 142.347,
    "end_seconds": 144.641,
    "text": "So not everyone has the same symptoms."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.641",
    "end": "00:02:26.893",
    "start_seconds": 144.641,
    "end_seconds": 146.893,
    "text": "But it's a serious illness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.893",
    "end": "00:02:28.311",
    "start_seconds": 146.893,
    "end_seconds": 148.311,
    "text": "Again, left untreated."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.770",
    "end": "00:02:33.316",
    "start_seconds": 148.77,
    "end_seconds": 153.316,
    "text": "We know globally it affects over 280 million people worldwide."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.650",
    "end": "00:02:34.943",
    "start_seconds": 153.65,
    "end_seconds": 154.94299999999998,
    "text": "So a huge number."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.943",
    "end": "00:02:36.695",
    "start_seconds": 154.94299999999998,
    "end_seconds": 156.695,
    "text": "Everybody in this room knows someone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.736",
    "end": "00:02:38.279",
    "start_seconds": 156.736,
    "end_seconds": 158.279,
    "text": "that's impacted by depression,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.321",
    "end": "00:02:41.157",
    "start_seconds": 158.321,
    "end_seconds": 161.15699999999998,
    "text": "whether they tell you about it or not."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.535",
    "end": "00:02:47.622",
    "start_seconds": 163.535,
    "end_seconds": 167.622,
    "text": "Moreover, depression is the leading cause of disability in the US."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.664",
    "end": "00:02:50.667",
    "start_seconds": 167.664,
    "end_seconds": 170.667,
    "text": "Disability meaning really loss of productivity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.709",
    "end": "00:02:52.335",
    "start_seconds": 170.709,
    "end_seconds": 172.335,
    "text": "both on the individual and family"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.377",
    "end": "00:02:53.712",
    "start_seconds": 172.377,
    "end_seconds": 173.712,
    "text": "and on society."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.007",
    "end": "00:03:03.430",
    "start_seconds": 178.007,
    "end_seconds": 183.43,
    "text": "Part of the focus that comes from studying depression, though,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.471",
    "end": "00:03:05.849",
    "start_seconds": 183.471,
    "end_seconds": 185.849,
    "text": "is really focused on antidepressants."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.890",
    "end": "00:03:08.184",
    "start_seconds": 185.89,
    "end_seconds": 188.184,
    "text": "And we all have heard of antidepressants."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.601",
    "end": "00:03:12.981",
    "start_seconds": 188.601,
    "end_seconds": 192.981,
    "text": "And how this came about was really completely randomly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.022",
    "end": "00:03:19.279",
    "start_seconds": 193.022,
    "end_seconds": 199.279,
    "text": "It was noticed that certain drugs had antidepressant effects,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.279",
    "end": "00:03:20.613",
    "start_seconds": 199.279,
    "end_seconds": 200.613,
    "text": "and as people studied it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.613",
    "end": "00:03:23.658",
    "start_seconds": 200.613,
    "end_seconds": 203.65800000000002,
    "text": "they realized that if you increase serotonin,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.700",
    "end": "00:03:25.618",
    "start_seconds": 203.7,
    "end_seconds": 205.618,
    "text": "you had an antidepressant effect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.660",
    "end": "00:03:27.912",
    "start_seconds": 205.66,
    "end_seconds": 207.912,
    "text": "So things like Prozac, Zoloft,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.954",
    "end": "00:03:30.206",
    "start_seconds": 207.954,
    "end_seconds": 210.206,
    "text": "common antidepressants,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.206",
    "end": "00:03:32.208",
    "start_seconds": 210.206,
    "end_seconds": 212.208,
    "text": "have been studied for decades,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.208",
    "end": "00:03:34.586",
    "start_seconds": 212.208,
    "end_seconds": 214.586,
    "text": "and we've seen ads on TV,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.586",
    "end": "00:03:36.254",
    "start_seconds": 214.586,
    "end_seconds": 216.254,
    "text": "in doctor's offices."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.254",
    "end": "00:03:39.966",
    "start_seconds": 216.254,
    "end_seconds": 219.966,
    "text": "People openly talk about the idea we're increasing serotonin,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.966",
    "end": "00:03:42.427",
    "start_seconds": 219.966,
    "end_seconds": 222.427,
    "text": "we're correcting our chemical imbalance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.844",
    "end": "00:03:44.179",
    "start_seconds": 222.844,
    "end_seconds": 224.179,
    "text": "But here's the thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.846",
    "end": "00:03:47.766",
    "start_seconds": 224.846,
    "end_seconds": 227.766,
    "text": "If you look at individuals with depression,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.807",
    "end": "00:03:50.310",
    "start_seconds": 227.80700000000002,
    "end_seconds": 230.31,
    "text": "many of them don't have decreased serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.351",
    "end": "00:03:52.020",
    "start_seconds": 230.351,
    "end_seconds": 232.02,
    "text": "They have normal levels."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.896",
    "end": "00:03:54.939",
    "start_seconds": 232.89600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 234.939,
    "text": "And that's a surprise to many people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.939",
    "end": "00:03:57.859",
    "start_seconds": 234.939,
    "end_seconds": 237.859,
    "text": "This idea that we had a measurable index of depression"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.901",
    "end": "00:04:00.904",
    "start_seconds": 237.901,
    "end_seconds": 240.904,
    "text": "just because it was less serotonin, many people talked about,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.945",
    "end": "00:04:02.697",
    "start_seconds": 240.945,
    "end_seconds": 242.697,
    "text": "but it really wasn't true."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.115",
    "end": "00:04:06.826",
    "start_seconds": 244.115,
    "end_seconds": 246.826,
    "text": "So that's been sort of surprising to many people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.577",
    "end": "00:04:09.829",
    "start_seconds": 247.577,
    "end_seconds": 249.829,
    "text": "But importantly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.871",
    "end": "00:04:14.292",
    "start_seconds": 249.871,
    "end_seconds": 254.292,
    "text": "SSRIs still are incredibly important treatment options."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.126",
    "end": "00:04:16.503",
    "start_seconds": 255.126,
    "end_seconds": 256.503,
    "text": "They help many people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.544",
    "end": "00:04:19.506",
    "start_seconds": 256.544,
    "end_seconds": 259.506,
    "text": "They are life-changing and they are life-saving."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.632",
    "end": "00:04:23.843",
    "start_seconds": 260.632,
    "end_seconds": 263.843,
    "text": "For many people, they really give them the will to live."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.053",
    "end": "00:04:28.723",
    "start_seconds": 265.053,
    "end_seconds": 268.723,
    "text": "The thing about SSRIs is that when you take them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.723",
    "end": "00:04:32.060",
    "start_seconds": 268.723,
    "end_seconds": 272.06,
    "text": "you have this increase in serotonin very quickly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.101",
    "end": "00:04:34.229",
    "start_seconds": 272.101,
    "end_seconds": 274.229,
    "text": "but they take weeks to work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.979",
    "end": "00:04:36.773",
    "start_seconds": 274.979,
    "end_seconds": 276.773,
    "text": "They don't work quickly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.773",
    "end": "00:04:38.608",
    "start_seconds": 276.773,
    "end_seconds": 278.608,
    "text": "And so why do they take weeks to work?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.608",
    "end": "00:04:41.236",
    "start_seconds": 278.608,
    "end_seconds": 281.236,
    "text": "And that's the part that we really don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.236",
    "end": "00:04:43.029",
    "start_seconds": 281.236,
    "end_seconds": 283.029,
    "text": "But again, they increase serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.071",
    "end": "00:04:46.825",
    "start_seconds": 283.071,
    "end_seconds": 286.825,
    "text": "So if it was simply fixing, it should happen quickly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.201",
    "end": "00:04:52.455",
    "start_seconds": 288.201,
    "end_seconds": 292.455,
    "text": "And so while again, they're incredibly important treatments,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.497",
    "end": "00:04:53.706",
    "start_seconds": 292.497,
    "end_seconds": 293.706,
    "text": "they are life saving."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.706",
    "end": "00:04:57.377",
    "start_seconds": 293.706,
    "end_seconds": 297.377,
    "text": "And if you're on an SSRI, you should continue to take your SSRI."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.377",
    "end": "00:04:59.128",
    "start_seconds": 297.377,
    "end_seconds": 299.128,
    "text": "That's an important message."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.128",
    "end": "00:05:01.047",
    "start_seconds": 299.128,
    "end_seconds": 301.047,
    "text": "But that's why some of the research"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.089",
    "end": "00:05:03.299",
    "start_seconds": 301.089,
    "end_seconds": 303.299,
    "text": "I’m going to talk to you today about ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.299",
    "end": "00:05:05.385",
    "start_seconds": 303.299,
    "end_seconds": 305.385,
    "text": "which my lab and group has been studying now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.385",
    "end": "00:05:07.637",
    "start_seconds": 305.385,
    "end_seconds": 307.637,
    "text": "for more than 15 years, has been so remarkable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.930",
    "end": "00:05:11.432",
    "start_seconds": 308.93,
    "end_seconds": 311.432,
    "text": "Ketamine, this is the structure of the drug."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.933",
    "end": "00:05:13.393",
    "start_seconds": 311.933,
    "end_seconds": 313.39300000000003,
    "text": "What's been noticed is,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.434",
    "end": "00:05:16.354",
    "start_seconds": 313.434,
    "end_seconds": 316.354,
    "text": "in a clinical study that had nothing to do with depression,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.354",
    "end": "00:05:18.189",
    "start_seconds": 316.354,
    "end_seconds": 318.189,
    "text": "it was just an observation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.231",
    "end": "00:05:19.816",
    "start_seconds": 318.231,
    "end_seconds": 319.816,
    "text": "they gave a low dose of ketamine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.816",
    "end": "00:05:21.901",
    "start_seconds": 319.816,
    "end_seconds": 321.901,
    "text": "And some of you may have heard of ketamine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.943",
    "end": "00:05:24.195",
    "start_seconds": 321.943,
    "end_seconds": 324.195,
    "text": "At high levels, it's an anesthetic,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.195",
    "end": "00:05:27.031",
    "start_seconds": 324.195,
    "end_seconds": 327.031,
    "text": "at more mid-level doses it's a party drug."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.031",
    "end": "00:05:29.701",
    "start_seconds": 327.031,
    "end_seconds": 329.701,
    "text": "But what they were doing was a study with an incredibly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.701",
    "end": "00:05:31.244",
    "start_seconds": 329.701,
    "end_seconds": 331.244,
    "text": "incredibly low dose."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.244",
    "end": "00:05:33.746",
    "start_seconds": 331.244,
    "end_seconds": 333.746,
    "text": "And for those individuals that were depressed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.788",
    "end": "00:05:35.039",
    "start_seconds": 333.788,
    "end_seconds": 335.039,
    "text": "that received ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.081",
    "end": "00:05:37.750",
    "start_seconds": 335.081,
    "end_seconds": 337.75,
    "text": "they had a rapid antidepressant effect --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.750",
    "end": "00:05:40.712",
    "start_seconds": 337.75,
    "end_seconds": 340.712,
    "text": "not within weeks, within hours."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.712",
    "end": "00:05:42.463",
    "start_seconds": 340.712,
    "end_seconds": 342.463,
    "text": "We didn't even know it was possible"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.505",
    "end": "00:05:44.716",
    "start_seconds": 342.505,
    "end_seconds": 344.716,
    "text": "to have an antidepressant effect that rapidly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.508",
    "end": "00:05:47.927",
    "start_seconds": 345.508,
    "end_seconds": 347.927,
    "text": "And so people have been studying why."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.261",
    "end": "00:05:49.929",
    "start_seconds": 348.261,
    "end_seconds": 349.929,
    "text": "What is this rapid effect?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.971",
    "end": "00:05:51.806",
    "start_seconds": 349.971,
    "end_seconds": 351.806,
    "text": "Because it really is remarkable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.724",
    "end": "00:05:55.935",
    "start_seconds": 352.724,
    "end_seconds": 355.935,
    "text": "And it doesn't just work in individuals that could be depressed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.977",
    "end": "00:05:59.939",
    "start_seconds": 355.977,
    "end_seconds": 359.939,
    "text": "It's really been studied in individuals that don't respond to SSRIs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.939",
    "end": "00:06:01.649",
    "start_seconds": 359.939,
    "end_seconds": 361.649,
    "text": "because not everyone responds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.483",
    "end": "00:06:04.652",
    "start_seconds": 362.483,
    "end_seconds": 364.652,
    "text": "And so it sounds pretty remarkable,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.694",
    "end": "00:06:08.781",
    "start_seconds": 364.694,
    "end_seconds": 368.781,
    "text": "but it's important to mention up front that ketamine does have risks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.823",
    "end": "00:06:10.742",
    "start_seconds": 368.823,
    "end_seconds": 370.742,
    "text": "And as with any drug,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.783",
    "end": "00:06:14.329",
    "start_seconds": 370.783,
    "end_seconds": 374.329,
    "text": "if it's not used correctly or given at very high levels,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.329",
    "end": "00:06:15.997",
    "start_seconds": 374.329,
    "end_seconds": 375.997,
    "text": "it can have adverse effects."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.039",
    "end": "00:06:20.877",
    "start_seconds": 376.039,
    "end_seconds": 380.877,
    "text": "So it's really, really important that things are followed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.919",
    "end": "00:06:24.213",
    "start_seconds": 380.919,
    "end_seconds": 384.213,
    "text": "in a manner as they should be, not just more-is-better."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.255",
    "end": "00:06:25.548",
    "start_seconds": 384.255,
    "end_seconds": 385.548,
    "text": "That is not the message."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.257",
    "end": "00:06:28.635",
    "start_seconds": 386.257,
    "end_seconds": 388.635,
    "text": "So we started studying ketamine"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.676",
    "end": "00:06:30.345",
    "start_seconds": 388.676,
    "end_seconds": 390.345,
    "text": "and other groups did as well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.386",
    "end": "00:06:32.722",
    "start_seconds": 390.386,
    "end_seconds": 392.722,
    "text": "And the first thing, which we all know,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:32.722",
    "end": "00:06:35.767",
    "start_seconds": 392.722,
    "end_seconds": 395.767,
    "text": "is that ketamine doesn't work on serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.808",
    "end": "00:06:38.728",
    "start_seconds": 395.808,
    "end_seconds": 398.728,
    "text": "It doesn't increase serotonin like SSRIs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.479",
    "end": "00:06:41.898",
    "start_seconds": 399.479,
    "end_seconds": 401.898,
    "text": "Instead, it actually focuses"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.940",
    "end": "00:06:45.068",
    "start_seconds": 401.94,
    "end_seconds": 405.068,
    "text": "on a different neurotransmitter system called glutamate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.068",
    "end": "00:06:48.821",
    "start_seconds": 405.068,
    "end_seconds": 408.821,
    "text": "And glutamate is what's important in fast communication in your brain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.280",
    "end": "00:06:52.867",
    "start_seconds": 409.28,
    "end_seconds": 412.867,
    "text": "Now what’s interesting is that ketamine targets glutamate,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.867",
    "end": "00:06:54.285",
    "start_seconds": 412.867,
    "end_seconds": 414.28499999999997,
    "text": "but it doesn't activate it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.661",
    "end": "00:06:55.912",
    "start_seconds": 414.661,
    "end_seconds": 415.912,
    "text": "It blocks it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.746",
    "end": "00:07:00.750",
    "start_seconds": 416.746,
    "end_seconds": 420.75,
    "text": "So why would blocking fast communication have any beneficial effect?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:01.376",
    "end": "00:07:03.753",
    "start_seconds": 421.376,
    "end_seconds": 423.753,
    "text": "And what we've been able to show is that ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.795",
    "end": "00:07:06.172",
    "start_seconds": 423.795,
    "end_seconds": 426.172,
    "text": "by blocking this fast communication,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:06.172",
    "end": "00:07:10.677",
    "start_seconds": 426.172,
    "end_seconds": 430.677,
    "text": "what it does is it actually strengthens particular connections in the brain,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.718",
    "end": "00:07:12.428",
    "start_seconds": 430.718,
    "end_seconds": 432.428,
    "text": "what we call synaptic plasticity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.470",
    "end": "00:07:14.389",
    "start_seconds": 432.47,
    "end_seconds": 434.389,
    "text": "It's just a change in your brain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.430",
    "end": "00:07:17.058",
    "start_seconds": 434.43,
    "end_seconds": 437.058,
    "text": "Your brain is able to adapt and strengthen connections."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.100",
    "end": "00:07:20.353",
    "start_seconds": 437.1,
    "end_seconds": 440.353,
    "text": "And we think that's what's driving the antidepressant effect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.604",
    "end": "00:07:24.899",
    "start_seconds": 441.604,
    "end_seconds": 444.899,
    "text": "And so as we've been studying this and trying to understand,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.941",
    "end": "00:07:26.526",
    "start_seconds": 444.941,
    "end_seconds": 446.526,
    "text": "OK, what does this mean?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.526",
    "end": "00:07:28.152",
    "start_seconds": 446.526,
    "end_seconds": 448.152,
    "text": "How does this work?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.112",
    "end": "00:07:32.407",
    "start_seconds": 449.112,
    "end_seconds": 452.407,
    "text": "What we've been able to show is that -- this is a nerve cell,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.448",
    "end": "00:07:36.828",
    "start_seconds": 452.448,
    "end_seconds": 456.828,
    "text": "this is one of the cells that we think actually are strengthening connections."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:37.453",
    "end": "00:07:40.206",
    "start_seconds": 457.453,
    "end_seconds": 460.206,
    "text": "As we're studying this and trying to understand it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.206",
    "end": "00:07:42.375",
    "start_seconds": 460.206,
    "end_seconds": 462.375,
    "text": "it's really providing a lot of different ways"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:42.417",
    "end": "00:07:44.460",
    "start_seconds": 462.41700000000003,
    "end_seconds": 464.46,
    "text": "of how we're framing what is depression."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.211",
    "end": "00:07:47.880",
    "start_seconds": 465.211,
    "end_seconds": 467.88,
    "text": "So first of all, it's reshaping treatment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.673",
    "end": "00:07:50.758",
    "start_seconds": 468.673,
    "end_seconds": 470.758,
    "text": "This is not a chemical imbalance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.800",
    "end": "00:07:53.511",
    "start_seconds": 470.8,
    "end_seconds": 473.511,
    "text": "We are not correcting a chemical imbalance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.511",
    "end": "00:07:55.430",
    "start_seconds": 473.511,
    "end_seconds": 475.43,
    "text": "The idea that someone may be broken,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.430",
    "end": "00:07:57.807",
    "start_seconds": 475.43,
    "end_seconds": 477.807,
    "text": "as people have talked about with depression,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:57.807",
    "end": "00:08:01.769",
    "start_seconds": 477.807,
    "end_seconds": 481.769,
    "text": "they're broken, they can't make an essential amino acid,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.811",
    "end": "00:08:04.731",
    "start_seconds": 481.811,
    "end_seconds": 484.731,
    "text": "essential transmitter like serotonin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.772",
    "end": "00:08:07.108",
    "start_seconds": 484.772,
    "end_seconds": 487.108,
    "text": "It's not the case because we're not correcting it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.108",
    "end": "00:08:08.693",
    "start_seconds": 487.108,
    "end_seconds": 488.693,
    "text": "We're not doing anything to it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.068",
    "end": "00:08:13.865",
    "start_seconds": 489.068,
    "end_seconds": 493.865,
    "text": "It's the idea that your brain can adapt and ketamine is able to tap into that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:14.407",
    "end": "00:08:17.493",
    "start_seconds": 494.407,
    "end_seconds": 497.493,
    "text": "So it changes the way that we're thinking about depression."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.493",
    "end": "00:08:20.747",
    "start_seconds": 497.493,
    "end_seconds": 500.747,
    "text": "Moreover, it's changing how we're reframing the timing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:21.205",
    "end": "00:08:24.792",
    "start_seconds": 501.205,
    "end_seconds": 504.79200000000003,
    "text": "Instead of an antidepressant requiring weeks to work,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.834",
    "end": "00:08:28.337",
    "start_seconds": 504.834,
    "end_seconds": 508.337,
    "text": "you can respond within hours, which is remarkable,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:28.379",
    "end": "00:08:32.091",
    "start_seconds": 508.379,
    "end_seconds": 512.091,
    "text": "especially for individuals that didn't respond to SSRIs"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:32.133",
    "end": "00:08:35.511",
    "start_seconds": 512.133,
    "end_seconds": 515.511,
    "text": "that may have been depressed without treatment for decades."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.763",
    "end": "00:08:38.723",
    "start_seconds": 516.763,
    "end_seconds": 518.723,
    "text": "And third, it's reframing hope."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.432",
    "end": "00:08:42.393",
    "start_seconds": 519.432,
    "end_seconds": 522.393,
    "text": "The idea that there are treatments, that you're not broken,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:42.435",
    "end": "00:08:46.064",
    "start_seconds": 522.435,
    "end_seconds": 526.064,
    "text": "that this is just a matter of getting your brain to respond,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:46.105",
    "end": "00:08:47.565",
    "start_seconds": 526.105,
    "end_seconds": 527.565,
    "text": "to respond to treatment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:48.149",
    "end": "00:08:50.401",
    "start_seconds": 528.149,
    "end_seconds": 530.401,
    "text": "And that, I think, is a really important message"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.401",
    "end": "00:08:52.320",
    "start_seconds": 530.401,
    "end_seconds": 532.32,
    "text": "of how we're thinking about the future."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.987",
    "end": "00:08:55.531",
    "start_seconds": 532.987,
    "end_seconds": 535.531,
    "text": "As we continue to study ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:55.573",
    "end": "00:08:58.159",
    "start_seconds": 535.573,
    "end_seconds": 538.159,
    "text": "there are many different aspects that we're looking at."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:58.159",
    "end": "00:08:59.327",
    "start_seconds": 538.159,
    "end_seconds": 539.327,
    "text": "And so, you know,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:59.368",
    "end": "00:09:01.913",
    "start_seconds": 539.368,
    "end_seconds": 541.913,
    "text": "with this diagram, we're showing two nerve cells"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:01.954",
    "end": "00:09:06.751",
    "start_seconds": 541.954,
    "end_seconds": 546.751,
    "text": "and just a neurotransmitter in this case ketamine, actually,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:06.751",
    "end": "00:09:08.461",
    "start_seconds": 546.751,
    "end_seconds": 548.461,
    "text": "which targets the glutamate system."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:08.503",
    "end": "00:09:11.130",
    "start_seconds": 548.503,
    "end_seconds": 551.13,
    "text": "Glutamate is being released and activated."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:11.130",
    "end": "00:09:14.008",
    "start_seconds": 551.13,
    "end_seconds": 554.008,
    "text": "As we're looking at how it's sort of causing this disruption,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:14.050",
    "end": "00:09:16.260",
    "start_seconds": 554.05,
    "end_seconds": 556.26,
    "text": "this blocking of transmission,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:16.302",
    "end": "00:09:17.470",
    "start_seconds": 556.302,
    "end_seconds": 557.47,
    "text": "we're actually thinking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:17.512",
    "end": "00:09:20.098",
    "start_seconds": 557.512,
    "end_seconds": 560.098,
    "text": "are there other ways to trigger this plasticity?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:20.431",
    "end": "00:09:22.809",
    "start_seconds": 560.431,
    "end_seconds": 562.809,
    "text": "Some people are looking at when you take ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.809",
    "end": "00:09:24.519",
    "start_seconds": 562.809,
    "end_seconds": 564.519,
    "text": "you have this window of plasticity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:24.519",
    "end": "00:09:26.979",
    "start_seconds": 564.519,
    "end_seconds": 566.979,
    "text": "Do you respond to therapy better during that time?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.979",
    "end": "00:09:30.775",
    "start_seconds": 566.979,
    "end_seconds": 570.775,
    "text": "Or what about to other drugs perhaps brain stimulation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.151",
    "end": "00:09:33.945",
    "start_seconds": 572.151,
    "end_seconds": 573.945,
    "text": "We also have been looking at it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.986",
    "end": "00:09:39.325",
    "start_seconds": 573.986,
    "end_seconds": 579.325,
    "text": "from a context of, can we extend ketamine's antidepressant effects?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:39.742",
    "end": "00:09:41.327",
    "start_seconds": 579.742,
    "end_seconds": 581.327,
    "text": "So as we look at this plasticity,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:41.327",
    "end": "00:09:45.665",
    "start_seconds": 581.327,
    "end_seconds": 585.665,
    "text": "what's important to remember is that it's like a painting analogy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:46.415",
    "end": "00:09:50.002",
    "start_seconds": 586.415,
    "end_seconds": 590.002,
    "text": "If you have a blank canvas and you paint,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.002",
    "end": "00:09:51.546",
    "start_seconds": 590.002,
    "end_seconds": 591.546,
    "text": "you're adding something new,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:51.546",
    "end": "00:09:54.090",
    "start_seconds": 591.546,
    "end_seconds": 594.09,
    "text": "but then you can dial in the colors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:54.132",
    "end": "00:09:56.342",
    "start_seconds": 594.132,
    "end_seconds": 596.342,
    "text": "You can make them vibrant,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:56.384",
    "end": "00:09:59.595",
    "start_seconds": 596.384,
    "end_seconds": 599.595,
    "text": "more brighter or less brighter, however you want."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:00.054",
    "end": "00:10:02.765",
    "start_seconds": 600.054,
    "end_seconds": 602.765,
    "text": "Ketamine is not painting the canvas."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:02.765",
    "end": "00:10:04.767",
    "start_seconds": 602.765,
    "end_seconds": 604.767,
    "text": "It's not creating new memories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:04.809",
    "end": "00:10:08.271",
    "start_seconds": 604.809,
    "end_seconds": 608.271,
    "text": "What it's doing is it's alleviating that despair."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:08.980",
    "end": "00:10:11.566",
    "start_seconds": 608.98,
    "end_seconds": 611.566,
    "text": "And some people describe, with depression,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:11.607",
    "end": "00:10:15.528",
    "start_seconds": 611.607,
    "end_seconds": 615.528,
    "text": "someone noted that, before ketamine treatment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:15.528",
    "end": "00:10:17.572",
    "start_seconds": 615.528,
    "end_seconds": 617.572,
    "text": "because they didn’t respond to SSRIs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:17.572",
    "end": "00:10:22.368",
    "start_seconds": 617.572,
    "end_seconds": 622.368,
    "text": "that they were really living in a dark room with no windows."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:22.368",
    "end": "00:10:23.744",
    "start_seconds": 622.368,
    "end_seconds": 623.744,
    "text": "And they couldn't get out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:24.328",
    "end": "00:10:25.496",
    "start_seconds": 624.328,
    "end_seconds": 625.496,
    "text": "After taking ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:25.538",
    "end": "00:10:27.290",
    "start_seconds": 625.538,
    "end_seconds": 627.29,
    "text": "it didn't make it a party house."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:27.707",
    "end": "00:10:32.670",
    "start_seconds": 627.707,
    "end_seconds": 632.67,
    "text": "What it did is it made it seem like the light was lifted and there was a door."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:33.963",
    "end": "00:10:35.339",
    "start_seconds": 633.963,
    "end_seconds": 635.3389999999999,
    "text": "And it provided hope."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:36.716",
    "end": "00:10:39.051",
    "start_seconds": 636.716,
    "end_seconds": 639.051,
    "text": "What ketamine is doing, in the painting analogy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:39.093",
    "end": "00:10:41.304",
    "start_seconds": 639.093,
    "end_seconds": 641.304,
    "text": "is it’s actually able to dial in --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:41.345",
    "end": "00:10:44.473",
    "start_seconds": 641.345,
    "end_seconds": 644.473,
    "text": "to lift the sort of despair, if you will."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:45.057",
    "end": "00:10:46.392",
    "start_seconds": 645.057,
    "end_seconds": 646.392,
    "text": "And that's important."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:46.434",
    "end": "00:10:49.937",
    "start_seconds": 646.434,
    "end_seconds": 649.937,
    "text": "So as we target this plasticity, we think about how can the brain adapt,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:49.937",
    "end": "00:10:51.564",
    "start_seconds": 649.937,
    "end_seconds": 651.564,
    "text": "how can it change,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:51.606",
    "end": "00:10:53.024",
    "start_seconds": 651.606,
    "end_seconds": 653.024,
    "text": "one of the things we're doing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:53.024",
    "end": "00:10:55.693",
    "start_seconds": 653.024,
    "end_seconds": 655.693,
    "text": "is that this antidepressant effect doesn't last forever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:55.735",
    "end": "00:10:57.320",
    "start_seconds": 655.735,
    "end_seconds": 657.32,
    "text": "Like flowers in a vase."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:58.112",
    "end": "00:11:01.240",
    "start_seconds": 658.112,
    "end_seconds": 661.24,
    "text": "Ketamine treatment lasts a few days and then it wanes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:01.741",
    "end": "00:11:03.784",
    "start_seconds": 661.741,
    "end_seconds": 663.784,
    "text": "So one of the things we've been able to do"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:03.826",
    "end": "00:11:09.373",
    "start_seconds": 663.826,
    "end_seconds": 669.373,
    "text": "is actually initiate studies to look at giving ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:09.415",
    "end": "00:11:11.250",
    "start_seconds": 669.415,
    "end_seconds": 671.25,
    "text": "triggering this antidepressant effect"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:11.292",
    "end": "00:11:14.128",
    "start_seconds": 671.292,
    "end_seconds": 674.128,
    "text": "and then can we sustain it longer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:14.128",
    "end": "00:11:17.590",
    "start_seconds": 674.128,
    "end_seconds": 677.59,
    "text": "so that you don't have to have another treatment so soon?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:18.591",
    "end": "00:11:21.928",
    "start_seconds": 678.591,
    "end_seconds": 681.928,
    "text": "And we're doing this through targeting, this plasticity,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:21.969",
    "end": "00:11:23.846",
    "start_seconds": 681.969,
    "end_seconds": 683.846,
    "text": "this adaptability in the brain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:24.096",
    "end": "00:11:25.890",
    "start_seconds": 684.096,
    "end_seconds": 685.89,
    "text": "And we think that's quite powerful,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:25.890",
    "end": "00:11:28.643",
    "start_seconds": 685.89,
    "end_seconds": 688.643,
    "text": "because again, it's not about having to fix something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:28.684",
    "end": "00:11:31.812",
    "start_seconds": 688.684,
    "end_seconds": 691.812,
    "text": "because again, given all the different symptoms,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:31.812",
    "end": "00:11:33.314",
    "start_seconds": 691.812,
    "end_seconds": 693.314,
    "text": "people have different levels --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:33.314",
    "end": "00:11:35.358",
    "start_seconds": 693.314,
    "end_seconds": 695.358,
    "text": "if it were a matter of fixing something."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:35.358",
    "end": "00:11:40.404",
    "start_seconds": 695.358,
    "end_seconds": 700.404,
    "text": "All we're trying to do is to tap in to the brain's ability to change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:41.572",
    "end": "00:11:44.158",
    "start_seconds": 701.572,
    "end_seconds": 704.158,
    "text": "And so where are we going with this?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:44.659",
    "end": "00:11:48.371",
    "start_seconds": 704.659,
    "end_seconds": 708.371,
    "text": "Well, ketamine, as I've told you, is a really remarkable treatment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:48.913",
    "end": "00:11:52.458",
    "start_seconds": 708.913,
    "end_seconds": 712.458,
    "text": "But it's not for everyone, and it's not without potential harm."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:52.917",
    "end": "00:11:57.463",
    "start_seconds": 712.917,
    "end_seconds": 717.463,
    "text": "If you are currently taking an SSRI, you should continue to take the SSRI."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:57.505",
    "end": "00:12:00.800",
    "start_seconds": 717.505,
    "end_seconds": 720.8,
    "text": "This is the first line of treatment for depression."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:01.175",
    "end": "00:12:03.928",
    "start_seconds": 721.175,
    "end_seconds": 723.928,
    "text": "It's for individuals that don't respond really,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:03.928",
    "end": "00:12:07.265",
    "start_seconds": 723.928,
    "end_seconds": 727.265,
    "text": "that have been most studied in terms of taking ketamine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:07.306",
    "end": "00:12:08.641",
    "start_seconds": 727.306,
    "end_seconds": 728.641,
    "text": "If you're interested in it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:08.641",
    "end": "00:12:11.060",
    "start_seconds": 728.641,
    "end_seconds": 731.06,
    "text": "you should talk to your health care provider."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:11.060",
    "end": "00:12:13.854",
    "start_seconds": 731.06,
    "end_seconds": 733.854,
    "text": "But we're using ketamine to try to understand, again,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:13.854",
    "end": "00:12:16.524",
    "start_seconds": 733.854,
    "end_seconds": 736.524,
    "text": "how do you generate an antidepressant effect?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:16.565",
    "end": "00:12:20.027",
    "start_seconds": 736.565,
    "end_seconds": 740.027,
    "text": "And the idea that it's not just an imbalance, again,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:20.069",
    "end": "00:12:22.238",
    "start_seconds": 740.069,
    "end_seconds": 742.238,
    "text": "that someone is not broken,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:22.280",
    "end": "00:12:24.198",
    "start_seconds": 742.28,
    "end_seconds": 744.198,
    "text": "maybe their brain is just sort of stuck."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:24.240",
    "end": "00:12:27.159",
    "start_seconds": 744.24,
    "end_seconds": 747.159,
    "text": "And ketamine allows you to adapt, to change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:27.702",
    "end": "00:12:30.579",
    "start_seconds": 747.702,
    "end_seconds": 750.579,
    "text": "And that, again, is what we think the response is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:31.122",
    "end": "00:12:33.040",
    "start_seconds": 751.122,
    "end_seconds": 753.04,
    "text": "And so as we continue to study ketamine,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:33.082",
    "end": "00:12:34.250",
    "start_seconds": 753.082,
    "end_seconds": 754.25,
    "text": "we and other labs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:34.250",
    "end": "00:12:37.336",
    "start_seconds": 754.25,
    "end_seconds": 757.336,
    "text": "we're trying to understand how can we make this better?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:38.004",
    "end": "00:12:41.632",
    "start_seconds": 758.004,
    "end_seconds": 761.632,
    "text": "How can we make this safer to work for more people?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:41.632",
    "end": "00:12:43.759",
    "start_seconds": 761.632,
    "end_seconds": 763.759,
    "text": "And how can we sustain the effect?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:44.135",
    "end": "00:12:47.972",
    "start_seconds": 764.135,
    "end_seconds": 767.972,
    "text": "And I think those are all really powerful messages of hope,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:48.014",
    "end": "00:12:51.100",
    "start_seconds": 768.014,
    "end_seconds": 771.1,
    "text": "because it's not just about seeking treatment today,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:51.142",
    "end": "00:12:53.769",
    "start_seconds": 771.142,
    "end_seconds": 773.769,
    "text": "which is incredibly important,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:53.811",
    "end": "00:12:57.565",
    "start_seconds": 773.811,
    "end_seconds": 777.565,
    "text": "but also for our children and our grandchildren and for others."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:57.565",
    "end": "00:12:59.567",
    "start_seconds": 777.565,
    "end_seconds": 779.567,
    "text": "Because this is a global issue"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:59.567",
    "end": "00:13:02.820",
    "start_seconds": 779.567,
    "end_seconds": 782.82,
    "text": "and this is something that there's a lot of work going on"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:13:02.862",
    "end": "00:13:05.614",
    "start_seconds": 782.862,
    "end_seconds": 785.614,
    "text": "that's really creating a lot of excitement in the field."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:13:06.240",
    "end": "00:13:08.951",
    "start_seconds": 786.24,
    "end_seconds": 788.951,
    "text": "And it's also the power of scientific research."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:13:08.951",
    "end": "00:13:10.119",
    "start_seconds": 788.951,
    "end_seconds": 790.119,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:13:10.119",
    "end": "00:13:11.287",
    "start_seconds": 790.119,
    "end_seconds": 791.287,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
